  "properties": {
    "title": "GRID3 COD - Health Areas v7.0",
    "description": "The GRID3 COD - Health Areas v7.0 dataset consists of health area boundaries with name, location, health zone, and other attributes for twenty-two provinces in the Democratic Republic of the Congo (COD). Province group 1: Haut-Katanga, Kasaï, Kasaï-Oriental, Kinshasa, and Lomami Province group 2: Haut-Lomami and Tanganyika Province group 3: Ituri and Kwilu Province group 4: Maniema Province group 5: Kasaï-Central Province group 6: Tshopo and Mongala Province group 7: Sankuru Province group 8: Kongo-Central Province group 9: Lualaba, Mai-Ndombe, Sud-Ubangi, Tshuapa Province group 10: Equateur, Nord-Ubangi, Sud-Kivu This operational dataset has not been fully validated by government officials or ministries. This current version supersedes the GRID3 COD - Health Areas v6.0 (https://doi.org/10.7916/n08k-g892). The following changes were made: Added data for the provinces of Equateur, Nord-Ubangi, Sud-Kivu. Keywords: Health Areas",
